{"5374810":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Tank Dungeon","steam_appid":5374810,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the battlefield green in a top-down action roguelite where driving, shooting and capturing territory go hand in hand. Dodge incoming fire, weave between obstacles and paint the floor beneath your vehicle to claim each arena.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies arrive on red tiles, so every square you capture leaves them less room to spawn. Push further and stronger golden enemies enter the fight, while waiting bosses awaken. Capture the entire arena to wipe out the remaining opposition and choose your next reward.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your favourite vehicle.<\/strong> Deploy a dependable tank, a fast Scout, heavy artillery, a helicopter or more specialised machines. Each has its own special weapon, from bouncing grenades and rocket barrages to the Chrono tank’s ability to slow the entire battle.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your arsenal.<\/strong> Choose a reward card after each cleared round. Stack extra cannons, homing rockets, lasers and helper bots, or improve the attributes that suit your playstyle.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect equipment and complete sets.<\/strong> Equip your driver with items that improve your vehicle. Hunt for Unique set pieces to unlock powerful bonuses and unusual abilities.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in your next run.<\/strong> Spend earned credits on permanent upgrades and new vehicles, then return to face tougher rounds.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play together or compete.<\/strong> Take on the campaign solo or with a friend in two-player local co-op. Switch to skirmish for territory battles with up to four local players or six players online.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer — Beta:<\/strong> Online PvP is playable, but still being developed and tested. You may encounter bugs or connection issues.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make skirmish your own.<\/strong> Choose teams, adjust the match timer and customise combat settings. Capture the whole floor, or hold the most territory when time runs out.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the battlefield green in a top-down action roguelite where driving, shooting and capturing territory go hand in hand. Dodge incoming fire, weave between obstacles and paint the floor beneath your vehicle to claim each arena.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies arrive on red tiles, so every square you capture leaves them less room to spawn. Push further and stronger golden enemies enter the fight, while waiting bosses awaken. Capture the entire arena to wipe out the remaining opposition and choose your next reward.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your favourite vehicle.<\/strong> Deploy a dependable tank, a fast Scout, heavy artillery, a helicopter or more specialised machines. Each has its own special weapon, from bouncing grenades and rocket barrages to the Chrono tank’s ability to slow the entire battle.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your arsenal.<\/strong> Choose a reward card after each cleared round. Stack extra cannons, homing rockets, lasers and helper bots, or improve the attributes that suit your playstyle.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect equipment and complete sets.<\/strong> Equip your driver with items that improve your vehicle. Hunt for Unique set pieces to unlock powerful bonuses and unusual abilities.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in your next run.<\/strong> Spend earned credits on permanent upgrades and new vehicles, then return to face tougher rounds.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play together or compete.<\/strong> Take on the campaign solo or with a friend in two-player local co-op. Switch to skirmish for territory battles with up to four local players or six players online.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer — Beta:<\/strong> Online PvP is playable, but still being developed and tested. You may encounter bugs or connection issues.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make skirmish your own.<\/strong> Choose teams, adjust the match timer and customise combat settings. Capture the whole floor, or hold the most territory when time runs out.<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Paint the arena and build your arsenal in a top-down action roguelite. Unlock vehicles, combine rockets, lasers and helper bots, and collect powerful equipment sets. Fight solo or in local co-op, then challenge friends in local or online territory-control skirmishes.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5374810\/b5766e38eab0102bf71c7d2eb75379b25174d93a\/header.jpg?t=1793712118","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5374810\/1588b80c31db78cf13150abcdec2d27e4fa0eabf\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793712118","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5374810\/1588b80c31db78cf13150abcdec2d27e4fa0eabf\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793712118","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> i3 10100<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce 2050<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and ope